cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying paper; authorship is TBD."
title: "The partially symmetric rank of products of binary monomials"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "TBD"
repository-code: "https://github.com/erenup/w-tensor-product-rank"
abstract: >-
  Exact complex partially symmetric rank formulas for all products of
  positive binary monomials with fixed symmetric blocks, including
  generalized W tensors. Includes the full product-moment and character
  proofs, seven universal algebraic targets in Lean, and exact finite checks.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - partially symmetric rank
  - W tensors
  - binary monomials
  - moment conditions
  - Gram matrices
